{"id":"f380a2598f68e7f2","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-order9-order-completion.md","title":"ZFC Order9 Order Completion","display":"df-zfc-order9-order-completion — ZFC Order9 Order Completion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order9-order-completion","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order9-order-completion"],"display":"df-zfc-order9-order-completion — ZFC Order9 Order Completion","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order9-order-completion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order9-order-completion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order9-order-completion — ZFC Order9 Order Completion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a9536cc1c6c86510\" href=\"?note=a9536cc1c6c86510\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\widehat P,\\leq_P,\\leq_{\\widehat P},e,u\\in V\">\\(P,\\widehat P,\\leq_P,\\leq_{\\widehat P},e,u\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Injective}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Injective}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9OrderCompletion}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9OrderCompletion}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}order\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9OrderCompletion}_S(\\widehat P,\\leq_{\\widehat P},P,\\leq_P,e)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(\\widehat P,\\leq_{\\widehat P})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,P,\\widehat P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(e,P,\\widehat P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n\\left(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow e(x)\\leq_{\\widehat P}e(y)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall c,u\\in\\widehat P\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall p\\in P\\;(e(p)\\leq_{\\widehat P}c\\to e(p)\\leq_{\\widehat P}u)\\bigr)\n\\to c\\leq_{\\widehat P}u\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall c,u\\in\\widehat P\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall p\\in P\\;(c\\leq_{\\widehat P}e(p)\\to u\\leq_{\\widehat P}e(p))\\bigr)\n\\to u\\leq_{\\widehat P}c\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}order\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9OrderCompletion}_S(\\widehat P,\\leq_{\\widehat P},P,\\leq_P,e)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_P,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(\\widehat P,\\leq_{\\widehat P})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,P,\\widehat P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(e,P,\\widehat P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\n\\left(x\\leq_P y\\leftrightarrow e(x)\\leq_{\\widehat P}e(y)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall c,u\\in\\widehat P\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall p\\in P\\;(e(p)\\leq_{\\widehat P}c\\to e(p)\\leq_{\\widehat P}u)\\bigr)\n\\to c\\leq_{\\widehat P}u\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall c,u\\in\\widehat P\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(\\forall p\\in P\\;(c\\leq_{\\widehat P}e(p)\\to u\\leq_{\\widehat P}e(p))\\bigr)\n\\to u\\leq_{\\widehat P}c\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The final two universal clauses are the least-upper-bound and greatest-lower-bound properties for the image elements below and above <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>; no undeclared supremum or infimum operation is used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","